  "static_checks_passed": [
    "Every final_stage entry requires the exact P3-10 selection and verifies the frozen sources, configuration, schedule and runtime before final action.",
    "Under the exclusive writer lock, the irreversible exposure marker is durably published before the inputs-stage generate callback receives the accepted final token.",
    "The public stage verifies all 12 input seals and passes only the unit, sealed public input and frozen arm configuration to each paid runner.",
    "The evaluation stage verifies all 500 public seals before calling any private score endpoint, and binds both public-result and input-result hashes in each score wrapper.",
    "Each score unit is the uniquely prefixed exact public unit. The analyzer requires the complete expected public-ID universe and rejects duplicates, unknown units, altered configurations and omissions.",
    "Result and seal publication are separate durable publish-once operations; unsealed orphan output is not completion; existing seals and start/result bytes are rechecked.",
    "One initial attempt plus at most one unchanged retry is enforced per stage. A recorded unexplained_infrastructure classification and nonempty investigator reason are mandatory for retry; sealed units are retained without rerun.",
    "Completed stages cannot be rerun as retries. A missing derived completion index is reconstructible from valid complete seals without invoking a method.",
    "Typed budget/service failure and semantic invalidity are preserved completed outcomes. Unexpected exceptions produce preserved failure records without automatic retry. A deterministic defect requires the protocol amendment route.",
    "The execution audit retains unknown cost for an unsealed public attempt; frozen analysis suppresses end-to-end positive economic flags when that accounting is incomplete.",
    "Incomplete broker episodes and unavailable/invalid reports retain their planned denominators and do not obtain a primary positive full-denominator claim.",
    "Private broker truth enumeration and certificate scalar-reference evaluation are in score endpoints, not the inspected public generate/run paths. Public incumbent/bound inputs and known conformance definitions retain their explicit task roles."
  ],
